<flow-navigation title="发展业务员" bind:back="handleBack" />
<view class="invite-page">
  <page-state wx:if="{{state !== 'success'}}" state="{{state === 'error' ? 'recoverable-error' : state}}" message="{{stateMessage || (state === 'revoked' ? '加入码已停用，刷新后可重新生成' : '')}}" bind:retry="loadInvite" />
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="invite-card"><text class="invite-title">业务员加入码</text><view class="invite-qr-wrap"><image wx:if="{{qrState !== 'error'}}" class="invite-qr" src="{{invite.qrImageUrl}}" mode="aspectFit" show-menu-by-longpress bindload="handleQrLoad" binderror="handleQrError" /><view wx:else class="invite-qr-error"><text>加入码图片加载失败</text><button class="invite-qr-retry tap-target" bindtap="refreshInvite" loading="{{saving}}" hover-class="tap-feedback" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="80">重新生成</button></view></view><text class="invite-org">{{invite.organizationName}}</text><text class="invite-description">新人扫码填写姓名并授权手机号后，将以普通业务员身份加入本组织。</text><text class="invite-meta">已加入 {{invite.joinedCount}} 人 · 有效期至 {{invite.expiresAtDisplay || invite.expiresAt}}</text></view>
    <button class="invite-primary" open-type="share">分享加入码</button>
    <view class="invite-actions"><button class="tap-target" bindtap="refreshInvite" loading="{{saving}}" hover-class="tap-feedback" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="80">刷新加入码</button><button class="invite-danger tap-target" bindtap="revokeInvite" hover-class="tap-feedback" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="80">停用加入码</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
